@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #17354c
skinparam classBackgroundColor #edf5f7
skinparam classBorderColor #087f8c
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title D06b | Separate moderation and release with revision guards
actor HoD
participant Console as UI
participant AssessmentService as S
participant AuthService as A
participant "IRepository / SQLite" as R
participant ILatePenalty as P
HoD -> UI : moderate(submission, expected revision, reason)
UI -> S : moderate(token, id, rev, optional raw/feedback, reason)
S -> R : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
S -> A : authorize(token)
S -> R : load course, department, current assessment
S -> S : require HoD scope, MARKED and matching rev
S -> P : calculate(raw, maximum, elapsed)
S -> R : save assessment / phase / old-new event
S -> R : COMMIT
S --> UI : MODERATED; new revision
HoD -> UI : refresh work, then release(new revision, reason)
UI -> S : transition(token, id, rev, RELEASE, reason)
S -> R : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
S -> A : authorize(token)
S -> R : reload current scope / phase / revision
S -> S : require MODERATED and matching revision
S -> R : save release metadata / phase / audit event
S -> R : COMMIT
S --> UI : RELEASED
note over S,R
Any validation or storage error rolls back the whole command.
Student results query filters RELEASED and authenticated student.
end note
@enduml
